    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "为什么分两次建图",
      "items": [
        "createFullBindingGraph=true 先跑全量图，让 BindingGraphPlugin 看到所有绑定并报错",
        "校验通过后用 createFullBindingGraph=false 只保留入口点可达绑定，再交给生成器"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "命名约定",
      "items": [
        "ComponentNames.getComponentName 在组件类名前后拼出 Dagger 前缀，所以 @Component CoffeeShop 得到 DaggerCoffeeApp_CoffeeShop",
        "实现类同包生成，文件由 XFiler 写出，originatingElement 指回组件接口"
      ]
    }
